1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/LOTHARINGIAN%20(LOWER)%20NOBILITY.htm#HeinrichIVSalmdied1292
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHANN [II] von Salm (c1335-after 1400).  Graf von Salm.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Married (after 22 May 1355) as her second husband, 
2 CONT
2 CONT PHILIPPA van Valkenburg, widow of GOTTFRIED von Heinsberg Comte de Chiny, daughter of JAN van Valkenburg & his first wife Maria van Cuyk.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann [II] & his wife had children: 
2 CONT # SIMON [II] von Salm (c1360-16 Jan 1397).  Graf von Salm.  
2 CONT
2 CONT *Married (after 1391) as her second husband, 
2 CONT
2 CONT MARIE de Luxembourg, widow of JEAN [II] de Condé Seigneur de Bailleul et de Morialmé, daughter of GUY de Luxembourg Comte de Ligny, de Roussy et de Saint-Pol & his wife Mathilde de Châtillon (-[1396]). 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://gw.geneanet.org/jpduf65?lang=en&iz=4&p=simon+ii&n=de+salm+en+ardennes Geneanet Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 29 2023, 14:08:43 UTC''
