1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *** 7 Feb. 23 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Souders has sent you a message:
2 CONT
2 CONT Re: Hendrik II van Nassau, heer van Loon op Zand
2 CONT Managers of Hendrik II van Nassau, heer van Loon op Zand,
2 CONT
2 CONT I am contacting you about this profile: https://www.geni.com/people/Hendrik-II-van-Nassau-heer-van-Loon-op-Zand/6000000006727823591
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Konrad Graf (1435-1495) is NOT a son of this person.
2 CONT
2 CONT This is mistaken data left over from an incorrect listing on Find A Grave (since deleted).
2 CONT
2 CONT Hendrik II had only one daughter with Genoveva von Birneburg, who died in 1437 giving birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Irmgard Schleiden (1419-1451) in 1440.
2 CONT
2 CONT This incorrect Geni listing has also caused mis-identification in several other places.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sincerely,
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Souders
2 CONT
2 CONT Sent by Janet Milburn
2 CONT ______________________________________________
2 CONT
