2 CONT
2 CONT Friedrich II, Graf von Fürstenberg & zu Heiligenberg, Landgraf in the Baar, Herr zu Trochtelfingen, Blumberg, Möhringen, & Jungnau was born on 19 June 1496 at Wolfach.1 A contract for the marriage of Friedrich II, Graf von Fürsten
2 CONC berg & zu Heiligenberg, Landgraf in the Baar, Herr zu Trochtelfingen, Blumberg, Möhringen, & Jungnau and Anna von Werdenberg was signed on 19 February 1516 at Ortenberg. Friedrich II, Graf von Fürstenberg & zu Heiligenberg, Landgr
2 CONC af in the Baar, Herr zu Trochtelfingen, Blumberg, Möhringen, & Jungnau died on 8 March 1559 at age 62; Buried at Bettenbrunn.1
