1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anna von Solms-Laubach, Gräfin zu Hohenlohe-Weikersheim''' was born on November 12, 1522 in Laubach, Oberhessen, Hessen-Darmstadt, Deutschland(HRR). Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-47103621 Otto l von Solms-Hohen
2 CONC solms-Lich, Graf zu Solms-Laubach] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-23224834 Anna von Mecklenburg-Schwerin]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna married [https://www.geni.com/profile-47102806 Ludwig Kasimir, Graf von Hohenlohe-Neuenstein] on November 11, 1540 in Rhomhild,Sachsen-Meiningn,Thüringen,Germany.  Together they had the following children:
2 CONT *[https://www.geni.com/profile-56368576 Wolfgang II, Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim];
2 CONT *[https://www.geni.com/profile-34625556073 Philips, graaf van Hohenlohe zu Langenburg];
2 CONT *[https://www.geni.com/profile-34625555918 Friedrich von Hohenlohe-Langenburg (von Hohenlohe-Neuenstein)];
2 CONT *[https://www.geni.com/profile-37974635 Dorthea von Hohenlohe-Neuenstein];
2 CONT *[https://www.geni.com/profile-34625555860 Albrecht von Hohenlohe-Kirchberg (Hohenlohe-Neunstein)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1586 in Erbach, Hessen-Darmstadt, Deutschland(HRR) and was buried in Öhringen, Jagstkreis, Württemberg, Deutschland(HRR). 
2 CONT ----
