1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anna van Nassau (Nassau), Gräfin zu Nassau-Dillenburg''' was born on November 5, 1563 in Breda, Noord-Brabant, Nederlande. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-35399300 Willem van Oranje] and [https://www.geni.com/pro
2 CONC file-72317028 Anna von Sachsen (Wettin, Albertiner), Prinzessin van Oranje-Nassau]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna married [https://www.geni.com/profile-71743919 Willem Lodewijk, graaf van Nassau-Dillenburg] on November 25, 1587. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on June 13, 1588 in Franeker, Friesland, Nederlande. 
2 CONT ----
