1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Count Joachim von Fürstenberg-Heiligenberg, Graf=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Friedrich II von Fürstenberg, Graf and Anna von Werdenberg
2 CONT * Joachim of Fürstenberg (1538–1598) was a Count of Fürstenberg-Heiligenberg, a vassalate of the Holy Roman Empire. His wife was Countess Anna of Zimmern. He was succeeded by his son, Frederick IV of Fürstenberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00005080&tree=LEO
2 CONT * http://www.our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p3074.htm#i92346
2 CONT * https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joachim_of_F%C3%BCrstenberg
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ersch, Johann Samuel; Gruber, Johann Gottfried (1850). "Fürstenberg". Allgemeine Encyklopädie der Wissenschaften und Künste in alphabetischer Folge (in German). Vol. 51. Leipzig: Brockhaus. p. 493.
