2 CONC ssance style fortress.
2 CONT
2 CONT Around 1560, the Elector Palatine enfeoffed George III, jointly with his father and his uncle Valentin II (16 July 1517 – 27 August 1563) with the district of Wildenstein.
2 CONT
2 CONT When his uncle George II (18 January 1506 – 27 August 1569) died, George inherited his territory and thereby all the possessions of the House of Erbach were reunited in one hand.
2 CONT
2 CONT Between 1588 and 1590 he expanded Fürstenau Castle.
2 CONT
