2 CONT Janet Milburn (Schultz) 3/04/22
2 CONT _______________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1610 he served his father in the Palatinate.
2 CONT * 1615 captain in the Hanseatic army. 1617 sent to Venice. 1621 Officer in the Dutch army. 1622 Infantry colonel. 1635 governor of Rmmerich. 1626-1637 governor of Heusden. 1633 field marshal. 1637-1642 govornor of Sluis.
2 CONT * 1641 severely wounded. He died in Orsoy.
