1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Karl II Graf von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen was born on 22 January 1547.1 He was the son of Karl I Graf von Hohenzollern and Anne von Baden-Durlach. He married, secondly, Elizabeth Gräfin von Cuylenburg in 1591. He m
2 CONC arried, firstly, Euphrosyne Gräfin von Oettingen-Wallerstein in 1569. He died in 1606.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Karl II Graf von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen gained the title of Graf von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen.
2 CONT
