2 CONT
2 CONT Philipp Zerbe was born 1682 in Kettenbach, Germany, and died Between 1722-1723 in New York.  He married Maria Catharina Steiber June 11, 1710 in Tappan, New York.  He and Maria had five children. Jacob Zerbe: Susana Maria Zerbe: G
2 CONC eorg Uri Servis: Abrahan Zerbe: Philipp Zerbe.  
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/111673888/johann-phillip-zerbe
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann Phillip is the s/o Martin Zerbe and Anna Elisabetha Elbert. He was born in Kettenbach, Germany. Johann Phillip married Maria Catherina Steiber on July 09, 1710 at West Camp Lutheran in Tappan, NY.
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT Johann Phillipp was baptized on Aug. 20, 1682 in Kettenback, Germany. He was the son of Martin and Anna Elisabetha Zirbe.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died about 1723. 
