2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Count of Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen/Prince of Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen 1606–1638'''
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [https://www.geni.com/people/Karl-II-von-Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen-Graf/6000000002632429078 Karl I] '''Successor:'''[https://www.geni.com/people/Meinrad-I-of-Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen-2-nd-Prince/6000000002632360
