2 CONT      Friedrich Ludwig Graf zu Nassau-Ottweiler was born on 13 November 1651. (1) He was the son of Johann Ludwig Graf von Nassau-Ottweiler and Dorothea Katharina Pfalzgräfin von Birkenfeld. (2), (1) He married Christine Ahlefeldt,
2 CONC  Comtesse d'Ahlefeldt, daughter of Frederik Ahlefeldt and Margarethe Dorothea Gräfin zu Rantzau, on 28 July 1680. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 25 May 1728 at age 76. (1)
