2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [https://www.geni.com/people/Meinrad-I-of-Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen-2-nd-Prince/6000000002632360173 Meinrad I]	'''Successor:''' [https://www.geni.com/people/Meinrad-II-von-Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen-Furst/60000000
2 CONC 02631714496 Meinrad II]
2 CONT
2 CONT Maximilian I Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen was born on 20 January 1636. He was the son of Meinrad I Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen and Anna Maria von Töring. He married Marie Klara von Berg in 1666. He died in 1689.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maximilian I Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen was a member of the House of Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen. He gained the title of Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Maximilian I Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen and Marie Klara von Berg
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Karl Meinrad II Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen+1 b. 1 Nov 1673, d. 1715
