1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.kuk-wehrmacht.de/biograph/f0029w%FCrttemberg.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Friedrich Ludwig, '''Herzog von Württemberg-Winnental''' - war Prinz von Württemberg-Winnental, kurfürstlich-sächsischer Reitergeneral und kaiserlicher Generalfeldzeugmeister.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fryderyk_Ludwik_Wirtemberski-Winnental
2 CONT
2 CONT http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Friedrich_Ludwig_von_W%C3%BCrttemberg-Winnental
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frederick_Louis_of_W%C3%BCrttemberg-Winnental
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frederick_Louis_of_W%C3%BCrttemberg-Winnental
2 CONT
2 CONT Frederick Louis of Württemberg-Winnental (November 5, 1690 in Stuttgart – September 19, 1734 in Guastalla) was a German army commander of the eighteenth century.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the third son of Frederick Charles of Württemberg-Winnental and Eleonore Juliane of Brandenburg-Ansbach.
2 CONT
2 CONT He learned the art of warfare in Dresden, Saxony. In 1708 he joined the Dutch Army and fought in the War of the Spanish Succession. In 1715 he returned to Saxony and fought against Sweden. In 1716 he fought under Prince Eugene of 
2 CONC Savoy against the Turks and participated in the Siege of Belgrade (1717). In 1732 he led an army of 7,000 men for Genoa against the insurgents in Corsica.
2 CONT
2 CONT War of the Polish Succession
2 CONT
2 CONT In the War of the Polish Succession, he commanded an army corps on the Italian front under Marshal Claudius Florimund Mercy. They suffered a defeat in the Battle of San Pietro and Mercy was killed.
2 CONT  Then Württemberg and Marshal Koenigsegg struggled for command, disturbing the preparations and readiness of the Austrian troops.
2 CONT
2 CONT This contributed to a second defeat in the Battle of Guastalla, where Württemberg was killed.
2 CONT
2 CONT Frederick Louis had married on 22 October 1722 the 42-year-old Ursula Catharina von Altenbockum , divorced Countess Lubomirski. She was one of the many ex-mistresses of August II the Strong. Ursula was 10 years older than Frederic
2 CONC k, and the marriage had pure financial reasons. They had no children.
